silm:instances_papers_07_the_canonical_question_chapters_05_free_construction_and_quotient_sections_01_free_generation_concrete_anchor_8#musicreadytunnelfunctor silm:hasLongDescription "The MusicReadyTunnelFunctor is F_music: the reality-tunnel functor from the music-record domain D_music into the canonical-question category O_07. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'F', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
